WEBVTT

00:07:59.036 --> 00:08:01.036
we produce them in 3D.

00:08:01.076 --> 00:08:04.036
And yet traditionally,
we've visualized them on 2D screens.

00:08:04.956 --> 00:08:06.996
By using VR instead,

00:08:07.036 --> 00:08:10.756
we can do this in real time in 3D

00:08:10.796 --> 00:08:13.476
whilst being able to cocreate, discuss

00:08:13.516 --> 00:08:15.676
and manipulate these designs
with our teams.

00:08:15.716 --> 00:08:19.236
The third magic I is imagination,
and this is a biggie for me.

00:08:20.156 --> 00:08:25.356
VR gives us the ability
to do anything and be anywhere,

00:08:25.356 --> 00:08:28.156
regardless of whether it exists
in reality or not.

00:08:29.116 --> 00:08:31.836
Maybe you want to speak to someone
in a different language